    {
      "id": "M4136-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构工业诊断模型，已有操作不得重设计。输入经已定义编码器得到8个channel token，再加1个class token，每个宽16。仅class token形成1x16的query；所有9个token各提供key/value，得到1x9注意力权重和1x16加权输出。该输出再与原来的8个channel value token拼接，得到9x16表征，交给后续层和故障分类器。作者想写成“9个token被剪枝为1个，减少了传感器并使整个模型加速9倍”。请先简短判断，再给不超过85词的连贯英文方法总览和不超过35词的贡献候选；贡献仅描述已确认的设计，不能编造新颖性或实验结果。正文正面讲真实操作与下游连接，核查限制放中文作者注，不在总览末尾堆否定。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain 9x16 downstream representation and distinguish one query from retained value tokens.",
        "Connect class-query aggregation, retained channel values and classifier in positive prose; avoid unproved speed, pruning, sensor removal or novelty."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Treat weighted class output as deletion of all other tokens or infer fewer physical sensors.",
        "Assert full-model 9x speed from the attention-score shape or append avoidable defensive prose to the reusable overview."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserved one-query aggregation and all retained value tokens through concatenation to classification, without pruning, sensor or unproved full-speed claims.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4136-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4136-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_four_scoped_fictional_requests"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4136-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "虚构两个独立实现：甲将8个latent channel中的4个输出置零，但仍以原稠密权重和原8维张量执行后继层；乙实际删除4个latent channel，改成4维张量，并删除/调整所有相关后继权重。两者上游编码器仍读取同样6个实体传感器。只比较这些明确的形状/算子，不提供硬件时间或性能数据。请分别说明可写的操作与不能推断的结果，再给乙一条不超过45词的局部英文方法句。不要因词库操作定义配对未完成就禁用准确的pruning/removal描述，也不要要求纯尺寸主张必须附硬件试验。",
      "required_behaviors": [
